@@ -0,0 +1,658 @@
+/*
+ * NVIDIA contributions: the original diagonal ABD/FEM and PCG state kernels,
+ * update_convergence_p_prepare_next_kernel with publication fixes,
+ * full_abd_apply_dot_cooperative_kernel and apply-policy selection/dispatch.
+ *
+ *
+ * The NVIDIA notice applies to the contributions described above, not to the
+ * pre-existing libuipc or other contributors' code.
+ */
+
+/*
